            "normalized_html": "<p>We define\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: u = \\log_{4} x|\u27f9u^{\u2032} = (1)/(x\\ln 4); v^{\u2032} = (1)/(x^{3})|\u27f9v = \u222b(1)/(x^{3})dx = \u2212 (1)/(2x^{2}).]</span></p><p>Using the formula of integration by parts, we get\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u222b(\\log_{4} x)/(x^{3})dx|= \u222buv^{\u2032}dx; = uv \u2212 \u222bvu^{\u2032}dx; = \\log_{4} x(\u2212 (1)/(2x^{2})) \u2212 \u222b(\u2212 (1)/(2x^{2}))(1)/(x\\ln 4)dx; = \u2212 (1)/(2x^{2})\\log_{4} x + (1)/(2\\ln 4)\u222b(1)/(x^{3})dx; = \u2212 (\\ln x)/(2x^{2}\\ln 4) + (1)/(2\\ln 4)(\u2212 (1)/(2x^{2})) + C; = \u2212 (\\ln x)/(2x^{2}\\ln 4) \u2212 (1)/(4x^{2}\\ln 4) + C; = \u2212 (2\\ln x + 1)/(4x^{2}\\ln 4) + C,]</span></p><p>Note that in the above calculation we used the change of base formula <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\log_4{x}=\\dfrac{\\ln{x}}{\\ln{4}}.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We define\n[MATH: u = \\log_{4} x|\u27f9u^{\u2032} = (1)/(x\\ln 4); v^{\u2032} = (1)/(x^{3})|\u27f9v = \u222b(1)/(x^{3})dx = \u2212 (1)/(2x^{2}).]\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n[MATH: \u222b(\\log_{4} x)/(x^{3})dx|= \u222buv^{\u2032}dx; = uv \u2212 \u222bvu^{\u2032}dx; = \\log_{4} x(\u2212 (1)/(2x^{2})) \u2212 \u222b(\u2212 (1)/(2x^{2}))(1)/(x\\ln 4)dx; = \u2212 (1)/(2x^{2})\\log_{4} x + (1)/(2\\ln 4)\u222b(1)/(x^{3})dx; = \u2212 (\\ln x)/(2x^{2}\\ln 4) + (1)/(2\\ln 4)(\u2212 (1)/(2x^{2})) + C; = \u2212 (\\ln x)/(2x^{2}\\ln 4) \u2212 (1)/(4x^{2}\\ln 4) + C; = \u2212 (2\\ln x + 1)/(4x^{2}\\ln 4) + C,]\n\nNote that in the above calculation we used the change of base formula [MATH: \\log_4{x}=\\dfrac{\\ln{x}}{\\ln{4}}.]",
