        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nEvaluate [MATH: \u222b_{1/5}^{e^{2}/5}\\ln (5x)dx.]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: (1)/(5)(e^{2} \u2212 1)]\nb. [MATH: e^{2} + 1]\nc. [MATH: (1)/(2)(e^{5} + 1)]\nd. [MATH: (1)/(5)(e^{2} + 1)]\ne. [MATH: 5(1 \u2212 e^{2})]"
      }
